 cancel hidden based on targeting.

renderLog:
 build li elements; types; include turn? Could prefix on turn change? Simple: text with small turn marker? We can render each with `data-turn`; maybe add span? Let's include turn in title attr. Newest at end.
 Only re-render if changed? simple each time; scroll bottom.
 Use DocumentFragment.
 If length 0, show empty li system.
