Autosave after player action? Currently autosave only at turn start. Maybe save after capture too? Could. Keep turn-start autosave. But if player quits mid-turn, loses actions. Accept? Better autosave after each player action so "autosave at dawn of every turn" text is wrong. Requirement only simple. Let's autosave after significant actions to be generous; update save meta. But then autosave might be during a battle. We can save after battle continue and after move/recruit/power. This is good UX. Update copy in save modal: "Your autosave follows every step of the war." Change text. Let's autosave after each action with helper autoSave(). Text in HTML currently "Your autosave is kept separately at the dawn of every turn." update to "Your autosave follows your steps and is kept separately." Let's edit later.

